{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"11":"The Rites of Hajj (Kitab Al-Manasik Wa'l-Hajj)"},"section_detail":{"11":{"hadithnumber_first":1721,"hadithnumber_last":2045,"arabicnumber_first":1721,"arabicnumber_last":2045,"name_native":"كتاب المناسك والحج"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1747,"arabicnumber":1747,"text":"حدثنا سليمان بن داود المهري، حدثنا ابن وهب، اخبرني يونس، عن ابن شهاب، عن سالم، - يعني ابن عبد الله - عن ابيه، قال سمعت النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم يهل ملبدا","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (1540) Sahih Muslim (1184)"}],"reference":{"book":11,"hadith":27}}]}